This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the claimant being aggrieved by the judgment dated 13.07.2021 passed by the Additonal Motor Accident Claims Tribunal and III Addl. District and Sessions Judge,
Ramanagara (for short, 'the Tribunal') in MVC No.319/2015.
